/P 217 0 R
/E (This focus area is about using AI to improve student engagement and learning while also establishing safeguards to ensure academic integrity and fairness. Students already use AI for brainstorming, drafting, summarizing, coding assistance, and study support. In many contexts, the temptation to outsource coursework is significant, particularly where expectations are unclear. Faculty should be able to clearly define acceptable use, whether through complete prohibition, restricted use, or transparent collaborative use.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [11]
>>
